WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.553
Sarah: I guess Fang won't be Pepper's friend.

2
00:00:09.554 --> 00:00:12.316
Sarah: Pepper doesn't like the chickens either.

3
00:00:12.317 --> 00:00:15.623
Riley: Snooks is still scared too.

4
00:00:15.624 --> 00:00:20.955
Skyler: Chatter and I will get the eggs.

5
00:00:20.956 --> 00:00:24.656
Skyler: There you go, Chatter. Out of your cage.

6
00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:30.145
Skyler: You can fly around the pen.

7
00:00:30.146 --> 00:00:36.029
Chickens: [i@Buk! Buk!@i]

8
00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:41.721
Skyler: Chatter! You're making a mess in the hay!

9
00:00:41.722 --> 00:00:45.855
Skyler: Chatter, that's not your nest! Ugh!

10
00:00:45.856 --> 00:00:57.267
Skyler: You smashed an egg. And another one! Oh no!

11
00:00:57.268 --> 00:01:00.805
Sarah: Skyler, did you get some eggs?

12
00:01:00.806 --> 00:01:06.279
Skyler: Only one. Chatter smashed some!

13
00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:09.256
Skyler: And the rest got broken too.

14
00:01:09.257 --> 00:01:16.531
Riley: Uh-oh. I hope Miss Brook can still make a cake.

15
00:01:16.532 --> 00:01:24.086
Ben: Here are Willy's combs and brushes.

16
00:01:24.087 --> 00:01:28.813
Kyle: Willy likes the grooming—he's sleeping!

17
00:01:28.814 --> 00:01:32.396
Theo: Let's go to the pond when we're done.

18
00:01:32.397 --> 00:01:39.003
Theo: Frankie will like—No, Frankie, stay!

19
00:01:39.004 --> 00:01:42.965
Frankie: [i@Ribbit! Ribbit!@i]

20
00:01:42.966 --> 00:01:44.902
Willy: [i@Hee-haw!@i]

21
00:01:44.903 --> 00:01:54.139
Theo: Frankie, stop hopping all around. You're scaring Willy!

22
00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:59.043
Theo: Back in my pocket, Frankie!

23
00:01:59.044 --> 00:02:02.347
Skyler: Hi, guys! We're going to feed the goats now.

24
00:02:02.348 --> 00:02:05.216
Sarah: Mack won't have any work today.

25
00:02:05.217 --> 00:02:07.999
Chatter: [i@Squawk!@i] What's up, Doc?

26
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:12.081
Willy: [i@Hee-haw!@i]

27
00:02:12.082 --> 00:02:14.553
Ben: Chatter is scaring Willy.

28
00:02:14.554 --> 00:02:17.198
Skyler: I'll move his cage away.

29
00:02:17.199 --> 00:02:22.111
Kyle: Willy is having a bad morning with your pets!

30
00:02:22.112 --> 00:02:28.167
Theo: Let's take them to the pond for a while.

31
00:02:28.168 --> 00:02:33.343
Ben: Speedy loves the pond. I'm glad we took a break.

32
00:02:33.344 --> 00:02:37.724
Theo: Willy's glad too. He needed peace and—

33
00:02:37.725 --> 00:02:41.450
Willy: [i@Hee-haw!@i]

34
00:02:41.451 --> 00:02:44.795
Theo: What's wrong now?

35
00:02:44.796 --> 00:02:48.044
Ben: Whoa, Kyle has a huge dog!

36
00:02:48.045 --> 00:02:51.122
Ben: And it's running toward Willy!

37
00:02:51.123 --> 00:02:54.077
Willy: [i@Hee-haw!@i]

